CCTPBridgeModuleFactory_Constructor
├── when the tokenMessenger is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModuleFactory_ZeroTokenMessenger
├── when the tokenMessenger has no deployed code
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModuleFactory_TokenMessengerNotContract
├── when the usdc address is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModuleFactory_ZeroUSDC
├── when the usdc address has no deployed code
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModuleFactory_USDCNotContract
└── when both addresses are valid contracts
    ├── it should set the tokenMessenger
    └── it should set the usdc address
